      "composition": "multiple-figures",
      "description": "A low engraved frieze of five small animals in a vine of curling stems, lobed leaves and a bunch of grapes. Left to right, a crouching hare faces right, a fox-like animal runs right head down, a curled animal with a bushy striped tail sits in the middle head tucked under, a boar-like animal runs left, and a slender long-tailed animal runs right looking back. Sepia-brown line work with cream hatching on a transparent background; the vine closes in loose scrolls at both ends, so the strip is complete and does not repeat.",
